  "reasoning": "The defendant deliberately used false personal information to obtain a credit card and then maliciously overdrew nearly 50,000 RMB with the intent of illegal possession. This conduct matches the statutory offense of credit‑card fraud (信用卡诈骗) under the Criminal Law. No other distinct offenses are supported by the facts.",
